  "description": "A prodigious young man was robbed of everything in the name of the law. The demon who murdered his father, Yang Da-Gon, has become the chairman of a global automotive company, competing with Tesla. What is taken by law is taken back by law! \n\nYun Hae-Seong, who became a lawyer, starts gathering suspicious figures. Can a small law firm with just two employees bring down the formidable Yang Da-Gon, who controls Korea? \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
